          "1. Buy a regional 3PL",
          "Cold sites, customers and operating skills from day one",
          "Mostly food: ~70% of volume, ~2-3% growth",
          "Acquisition premium; integration into a freight forwarder",
          "Are there targets with pharma-grade sites near hubs?"
