         [
          "2. Greenfield pharma-grade sites near hubs",
          "New capacity where utilisation is tightest",
          "Direct: pharma grows ~11% a year",
          "$220-260 per sq ft to build; no cold track record",
          "Can we win pharma customers without a track record?"
