               "role": "type.body_large",
               "text": "On market grounds, yes: ~$95bn growing about 7% a year, pharma about 11%",
               "bullet_level": 0
              },
              {
               "role": "type.body_large",
               "text": "Capacity is tight at ~82% utilisation, which supports pricing",
               "bullet_level": 0
              },
              {
               "role": "type.body_large",
               "text": "Against it: build cost about 2x ambient and no cold capability in-house today",
               "bullet_level": 0
              }
